<title>USA: CME live cattle certificates for Oct 31.</title>
<headline>CME live cattle certificates for Oct 31.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange reported the following certificates tendered for October 31 against the October Live Cattle contract.</p>
<p>No contracts open. Total to date tenders and retenders 94 (tenders 92, retenders 2), demands 22, reclaims 0.</p>
<p>Carcass deliveries for Oct 31 - Amarillo TX 4, Clovis NM 5, Dodge City KS 3, Guymon OK 3.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
